{# =====================================================================
   Visio Sapiens — MOBILE NAVIGATION (shared partial)
   Include:  {% raw %}{% include '_nav_mobile.j2' %}{% endraw %}

   EN | A vertical rail does not fit on a phone. The mobile navigation is a
   EN | ONE-LINE HORIZONTALLY SCROLLING CHIP BAR, transposed from the proven
   EN | pattern of the breaker-panel table in energy_mobile:
   EN |   - an outer button-card with tap_action:none;
   EN |   - a custom field of FIXED width, WIDER than the screen, so the
   EN |     scroll exists mechanically;
   EN |   - overflow-x + touch-action:pan-x on the card (mirror of the pan-y
   EN |     that works on vertical lists);
   EN |   - inside, a native grid of one row holding the chips.
   FR | Un bandeau vertical ne tient pas sur un telephone. La navigation
   FR | mobile est une BARRE DE CHIPS SUR UNE LIGNE, DEFILANT
   FR | HORIZONTALEMENT, transposee du pattern eprouve du tableau electrique
   FR | d'energy_mobile :
   FR |   - une button-card externe avec tap_action:none ;
   FR |   - un champ custom de largeur FIXE, PLUS LARGE que l'ecran, donc le
   FR |     defilement existe mecaniquement ;
   FR |   - overflow-x + touch-action:pan-x sur la carte (miroir du pan-y qui
   FR |     fonctionne sur les listes verticales) ;
   FR |   - a l'interieur, une grille native d'une ligne portant les chips.

   EN | CRITICAL — the inner width and the column count are computed from the
   EN | nav list, not hardcoded. The hand-written version used `columns: 12`
   EN | and `width: 1240px`, which were correct for exactly twelve entries.
   EN | With a dynamic rail (4 system entries + N rooms) a fixed 12 would
   EN | wrap the chips onto invisible rows as soon as a room is added.
   FR | CRITIQUE — la largeur interne et le nombre de colonnes sont calcules
   FR | depuis la liste nav, pas codes en dur. La version ecrite a la main
   FR | utilisait `columns: 12` et `width: 1240px`, justes pour exactement
   FR | douze entrees. Avec un bandeau dynamique (4 entrees systeme + N
   FR | pieces), un 12 fixe replierait les chips sur des lignes invisibles
   FR | des l'ajout d'une piece.

   EN | EXPECTED CONTEXT / FR | CONTEXTE ATTENDU
     nav, active_nav
   ================================================================== #}
{# EN | An entry with `mobile: false` is dropped: the admin console is desk
       work and a phone has room for only a handful of chips. The width and
       column count below are computed from the FILTERED list, otherwise the
       bar would reserve space for a chip it never draws.
   FR | Une entree avec `mobile: false` est ecartee : la console admin est un
       travail de bureau et un telephone n a de place que pour une poignee de
       chips. La largeur et le nombre de colonnes ci-dessous sont calcules sur
       la liste FILTREE, sinon la barre reserverait la place d un chip qu elle
       ne dessine jamais. #}
{% set mobile_nav = nav | rejectattr('mobile', 'defined') | list
                  + nav | selectattr('mobile', 'defined') | selectattr('mobile') | list %}
{% set chip_width = 104 %}
      - type: custom:button-card
        view_layout:
          grid-area: nav
        show_icon: false
        show_name: false
        show_state: false
        tap_action:
          action: none
        styles:
          grid:
            - grid-template-areas: '"chips"'
          card:
            - background: transparent
            - box-shadow: none
            - border: none
            - border-radius: 0
            - padding: 0px 0px 4px 0px
            {# EN | Viewport-unit ceiling: bounds what the card contributes to
               EN | the grid computation, so the bar cannot claim its full
               EN | inner width from the page and the scrolling stays internal.
               FR | Plafond en unite viewport : borne la contribution de la
               FR | carte au calcul de la grille, donc la barre ne peut pas
               FR | reclamer sa largeur interne a la page et le defilement
               FR | reste interne. #}
            - max-width: calc(100vw - 16px)
            - overflow-x: auto
            - overflow-y: hidden
            - touch-action: pan-x
            - "-webkit-overflow-scrolling": touch
            - scrollbar-width: none
            - cursor: default
          custom_fields:
            chips:
              - display: block
              - width: {{ mobile_nav | length * chip_width }}px
        custom_fields:
          chips:
            card:
              type: grid
              columns: {{ mobile_nav | length }}
              square: false
              cards:
{% for item in mobile_nav %}
                - type: custom:button-card
                  name: "{{ item.name }}"
                  icon: {{ item.icon }}
                  size: 14px
                  tap_action:
                    action: navigate
                    navigation_path: {{ item.path_mobile }}
                  styles:
                    grid:
                      - grid-template-areas: '"i n"'
                      - grid-template-columns: auto 1fr
                      - column-gap: 4px
                      - align-items: center
                    card:
                      - height: 36px
                      - padding: 0px 8px
                      - border-radius: 12px
{% if item.id == active_nav %}
                      - background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-color, #00E5FF) 14%, transparent)
                      - border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-color, #00E5FF) 55%, transparent)
                      - box-shadow: 0 0 12px color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-color, #00E5FF) 25%, transparent)
{% else %}
                      - background: rgba(16,27,39,0.85)
                      - border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-color, #00E5FF) 18%, transparent)
                      - box-shadow: none
{% endif %}
                    icon:
                      - width: 14px
{% if item.id == active_nav %}
                      - color: "#00E5FF"
{% else %}
                      - color: "#8FB6C9"
{% endif %}
                    name:
                      - font-family: Orbitron, sans-serif
                      - font-size: 8px
                      - letter-spacing: 0.5px
{% if item.id == active_nav %}
                      - color: "#00E5FF"
{% else %}
                      - color: "#8FB6C9"
{% endif %}
                      - justify-self: start
                      - white-space: nowrap
                      - overflow: hidden
                      - text-overflow: ellipsis
{% endfor %}
